SAX parsing system and TkVisIPS interface

Nara Institute of Science and Technology, May 1996
Copyright (C) 1996 Takuya Nakayama, Yuji Matsumoto

./SAX		: SAX parser for Definete Clause Grammars
./SAX/VisIPS	: Interface programs for VisIPS
./SAX/sax_user	: Configuration programs
./SAX/grammar	: sample grammars
./SAX/Utility	: utility programs
./SAX/doc	: user manual of SAX system
./TkVisIPS	: Interface for parsing systems developed in Tkl/Tk
./TkVisIPS/TkVisIPS.ps	: user manual of TkVisIPS

Note: Before running TkVisIPS with the SAX parser, modify
SAX/VisIPS/initialize.pl so that "host machine", "port number"
and "installed directory" are specified properly.

